<title>FRANCE: Jospin for &quot;concrete&quot; action on EU policies - paper.</title>
<headline>Jospin for &quot;concrete&quot; action on EU policies - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Lionel Jospin wants &quot;concrete measures&quot; to improve European policy co-ordination in favour of growth and jobs, afternoon daily Le Monde said on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave no source for this.</p>
</text>
